{"name":"Graceful Gazelle","hex":"#a78a50","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"graceful","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having or showing grace in movement, shape, or proportion.","Magnanimous, lacking arrogance or complaint; gracious."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/graceful"},{"term":"gazelle","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An antelope of either of the genera Gazella (mostly native to Africa),  Procapra (native to Asia), Eudorcas, or Nanger, capable of running at high speeds for long periods."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To leap like a gazelle.","To go fast; to speed; to rush."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/gazelle"}],"entries":[{"title":"Gazelle","blocks":[{"text":"A gazelle is one of many antelope species in the genus Gazella. There are also seven species included in two further genera; Eudorcas and Nanger, which were formerly considered subgenera of Gazella. A third former subgenus, Procapra, includes three living species of Asian gazelles."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Chinkara_-_Shreeram_M_V_-_Bikaner.jpg/330px-Chinkara_-_Shreeram_M_V_-_Bikaner.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gazelle","wikidata":"Q29001815"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Chinkara_-_Shreeram_M_V_-_Bikaner.jpg/500px-Chinkara_-_Shreeram_M_V_-_Bikaner.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Chinkara_-_Shreeram_M_V_-_Bikaner.jpg/1280px-Chinkara_-_Shreeram_M_V_-_Bikaner.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Chinkara_-_Shreeram_M_V_-_Bikaner.jpg/500px-Chinkara_-_Shreeram_M_V_-_Bikaner.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_con